WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.100
 I expected this. He has written a few words. His speech is probably 15 seconds

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:14.000
 long. So, here it goes.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.010
 To the committee members, friends, attendees, and all residents of Cleveland, I'm

00:00:21.010 --> 00:00:25.000
 extremely honored and thankful for this election.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:32.840
 Cleveland International Hall of Fame. I came to America 47 years ago and stayed

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:38.000
 in Cleveland ever since. Cleveland and America has been very good to me.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.520
 I also wish to thank my family for their unconditional support to me in all my

00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:52.000
 undertakings and now taking care of me in my period of illness and disability.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:56.000
 Thanks again many, many times to all.

